ovim/neovim/milestones/6","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/milestone/6","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones/6/labels","id":655037,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjU1MDM3","number":6,"title":"backlog","description":"Low priority items. We plan to work on this but don't have a target date.","creator":{"login":"justinmk","id":1359421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTk0MjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1359421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk","html_url":"https://github.com/justinmk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/justinmk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":640,"closed_issues":761,"state":"open","created_at":"2014-05-10T20:43:04Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T21:14:43Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2017-01-17T19:52:27Z","updated_at":"2017-02-06T23:40:06Z","closed_at":"2017-02-06T23:40:06Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- `nvim --version`:\r\n0.1.7\r\n- Vim (version: ) behaves differently?\r\n8.0 NO, same problem\r\n\r\n### Actual behaviour\r\nDouble clicking on a quickfix or location list item with the mouse moves to that position as expected, but also sets the command register to `.cc` or `.ll` respectively.\r\n\r\n### Expected behaviour\r\nThe command register `\":` should not be changed\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce using `nvim -u NONE`\r\n\r\n```\r\nnvim -u NONE src/nvim/undo.c\r\n:vimgrep ls %\r\n:copen\r\n<double click on an item in the quickfix list>\r\n:registers\r\n```\r\n\r\nObserve that the \": register is currently `.cc`.\r\n\r\n# Cause\r\nThis is because of how the double click action is implemented.\r\nIn `normal.c:2983` you see that it's implemented by stuffing `readbuf1` with an ex command, this is treated as user input and hence the ex command is stored in the `\":` register.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jamessan","id":112971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjk3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan","html_url":"https://github.com/jamessan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jamessan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/5966/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}